{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"But now to the matter. So the arrangement with the Englishman to take a hired coach from Magdeburg here has come to nothing; so we set out on the diligence in Magdeburg on Monday noon — to Brunswick. This route to Cassel is the most common, only one or two miles longer than the one I had in mind as the most direct, — has excellent country roads everywhere and good post coaches; and here I must make amends to the Prussian postal service, against which I was indignant in the last letter because of the other routes; the coach is upholstered, lined with green morocco leather, and so forth. Around 5 o'clock in the morning on Tuesday we arrived in Brunswick. — When the suggestion to go via Brunswick was made, it had occurred to me anyway that Mr. Government Commissioner Schulz had told me about a painting that is located there, and which alone is worth a journey. — We have therefore seen the local museum, especially the painting gallery and therein entirely distinguished and outstanding pieces. The painting that Mr. Government Commissioner had in mind is particularly of entirely peculiar excellence."}}],"created":1795218882,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":229,"prompt_tokens":364,"total_tokens":593,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-LrX2Piq3KpTK9glk1a8ZaShj4TTKD9fd","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":364,"prompt_ms":472.448,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.297934065934066,"prompt_per_second":770.4551612029261,"predicted_n":229,"predicted_ms":5349.09,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.46092105263158,"predicted_per_second":42.62407250579071}}